			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4096723">
									

<p>If you told me someone wrote a skip about sapient dark matter intelligence in our solar system, I would assume that the tone would be dark.</p>
<p>After reading, I'm genuinely tickled that they seem to be not only benevolent, but utterly innocent and childlike. This skip is damn refreshing. Personally, I'd love a tale focused on the person (child?) that 4170 is speaking with.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>I was untruthful when we first met. I told you I was not lonely, and that was a lie]. [Assertion: I had never had a friend until I met you]. [Assertion: Even though your parents are unkind, they somehow managed to create the kindest person in the Solar System].</p>
</blockquote>
<p>^That right there. That shit made me tear up. Bravo and +1.</p>
<p>Edit: I'm genuinely curious about the only -1 rating.</p>

